<title>RUSSIA: REUTERS 16TH EX-MOSCOW AIR CARGO MARKET REPORT.</title>
<headline>REUTERS 16TH EX-MOSCOW AIR CARGO MARKET REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current, average ex-Moscow air cargo market rates in U.S. dollars per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six to one.</p>
<p>These rates exclude any cargo fuel surcharges applied by foreign airlines.</p>
<p>			 Aug 13    July 17</p>
<p>			    EUROPE</p>
<p>    SVO FRA	   1.14	1.14</p>
<p>    SVO-LON	   1.20	1.21</p>
<p>    SVO-LUX	   1.34	1.34</p>
<p>			   ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>    SVO-SIN	   4.01	4.00</p>
<p>    SVO-BKK	   3.31	3.31</p>
<p>    SVO-SEL	   4.01	4.02</p>
<p>    SVO-NRT	   4.30	4.29</p>
<p>			   MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>    SVO-DXB	   2.03	2.03</p>
<p>    SVO-SHJ	   2.40	2.40</p>
<p>			  UNITED STATES</p>
<p>    SVO-MIA	   3.38	3.37</p>
<p>    SVO-NYC	   2.64	2.64</p>
<p>    SVO-SFO	   3.25	3.26</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Moscow's Sheremetyevo international airport. All prices are quoted in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
<p>- www.racs.com</p>
